message: "If you use hilbertplot in your work, please cite this software."
type: software
title: hilbertplot
doi: 10.5281/zenodo.23858267
authors:
  - family-names: Estevez
    given-names: Daniel
repository-code: "https://github.com/El3ssar/hilbertplot"
url: "https://github.com/El3ssar/hilbertplot"
license: MIT
abstract: >-
  Plot one-dimensional numeric sequences along forty two-dimensional Hilbert-type
  curves, and convert images and arrays to and from sequences along a selected
  curve path. Includes square and quasisquare constructions, direct coordinate
  indexing, Fourier transforms, difference maps, and sequence granularity controls.
keywords:
  - Hilbert curves
  - space-filling curves
  - scientific visualization
  - array conversion
  - locality
